Vertex shader reads instance data:
```glsl
layout(location=5) in mat3x4 iModelMatrix;  // per-instance

void VS() {
    vec4 worldPos = vec4(iModelMatrix * vec4(iPos, 1.0), 1.0);
    gl_Position = cViewProj * worldPos;
}
